WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.706 --> 00:00:12.711
October 27th, 28th, 29th, 30th, 31st—oh no!

2
00:00:13.251 --> 00:00:18.113
There are only five more days until Halloween, and we're not ready.

3
00:00:18.674 --> 00:00:22.336
But we won't panic: we just need a good plan.

4
00:00:24.197 --> 00:00:27.379
Today Dad will drive us to the pumpkin patch.

5
00:00:28.059 --> 00:00:29.780
We will search and search.

6
00:00:30.472 --> 00:00:32.934
We'll see pumpkins that are too small.

7
00:00:33.374 --> 00:00:34.655
We won't want those.

8
00:00:36.796 --> 00:00:39.938
We will also see pumpkins that are funny shaped.

9
00:00:40.559 --> 00:00:42.100
We won't want those either.

10
00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:45.562
We will search for the perfect pumpkin.

11
00:00:47.524 --> 00:00:51.446
On the twenty-eighth, Mom will help us carve the pumpkin.

12
00:00:52.187 --> 00:00:55.249
We will take out the seeds and slimy stuff.

13
00:00:56.009 --> 00:00:57.910
Mom will bake the seeds for us.

14
00:00:59.451 --> 00:01:08.002
Mmm! We'll cut out scary eyes, a pointy nose, and a mouth with teeth.

15
00:01:08.842 --> 00:01:12.323
When we are finished, we'll have a jack-o'-lantern.

16
00:01:13.223 --> 00:01:16.624
He'll be scary!

17
00:01:17.424 --> 00:01:20.945
On the twenty-ninth, we will put up the decorations.

18
00:01:21.605 --> 00:01:26.647
We will make witches, moons, black cats, and scary bats.

19
00:01:27.447 --> 00:01:30.468
Then we'll put them in our front windows and door.

20
00:01:32.620 --> 00:01:38.144
Dad will bring home a big bundle of hay, and Mom will sit the scarecrow on it.

21
00:01:39.205 --> 00:01:42.627
Then Dad will put a red lightbulb over the door.

22
00:01:43.448 --> 00:01:45.949
That will really make our house spooky.

23
00:01:48.151 --> 00:01:51.213
On the thirtieth, we will make our costumes.

24
00:01:51.954 --> 00:01:53.515
I'm going to be a pirate.

25
00:01:54.195 --> 00:01:59.659
I'll have a patch over my eye, a long sword, and a hook for my left hand.

26
00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:03.322
My sister will be a mummy.

27
00:02:03.963 --> 00:02:07.226
We will wrap her in white cloth from head to toe.

28
00:02:07.786 --> 00:02:11.910
The last things we will need are two baskets for our candy.

29
00:02:13.511 --> 00:02:15.994
October 31st is Halloween.

30
00:02:16.874 --> 00:02:20.338
After dinner we will quickly put on our costumes.

31
00:02:21.198 --> 00:02:23.861
Mom will paint a black beard on my face.

32
00:02:24.621 --> 00:02:30.360
Then Dad will take us out to trick-or-treat.

33
00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:34.861
We will have to walk fast because there are so many houses to visit.

34
00:02:35.582 --> 00:02:41.643
At each house we will knock on the door and say, "Trick or treat."

35
00:02:42.944 --> 00:02:48.425
After a long night of trick-or-treating, we will bring home our baskets of candy.

36
00:02:49.185 --> 00:02:52.506
Mom likes chocolate, so we can give her some.

37
00:02:53.126 --> 00:02:56.247
Dad likes peanuts, so we can give him those.

38
00:02:57.227 --> 00:02:59.148
That is our Halloween plan.

39
00:03:00.070 --> 00:03:01.980
Let's go to the pumpkin patch!
